@startuml MoodRefreshment_Sequence_GoogleAuth
actor User
participant "LoginScreen" as App
participant "Express API" as API
participant "Google OAuth" as Google
database "SQLite Users" as DB

User -> App : Tap Sign in with Google
App -> Google : Obtain access token
App -> API : POST /api/auth/google-custom\n{access_token}

API -> Google : GET userinfo (Bearer token)
Google --> API : {email, name}

API -> DB : SELECT * FROM Users WHERE email=?

alt User exists
  DB --> API : user row
  API --> App : 200 user JSON
else New user
  API -> DB : INSERT Users\n(anon display name, avatar, color)
  DB --> API : new id
  API --> App : user JSON
end

App -> App : AsyncStorage.setItem("user")
App -> User : Navigate to Home
@enduml
